    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Infection Control Society of Pakistan (ICSP), in collaboration with the Aga Khan University (AKU), held its Fourth International Conference on \"Infection Control Challenges in the New Millennium,\" from November 23-24, 2000. In his keynote address, Mr. John Templeton, Chief Executive, Craigvo Area Hospital, UK, emphasised that \"A coherent strategy is required to address the problem. Antibiotics are not an excuse for bad practice. It is crucial that the dissemination of knowledge on disease prevention and control filters to the grass roots level.\"",
